each of which has a corresponding Buddha.<ref name="Ten Grotenhuis-1999a" /> Four original members<ref name=":0" /><ref name="www.kasugataisha.or.jp" /> and then the fifth member {{ill|Ame-no-Oshikumone|en|Draft:Ame-no-Oshikumone|ja|天押雲根命|simple|User:Immanuelle/Ame-no-Oshikumone|fr|Utilisateur:Immanuelle/Ame-no-Oshikumone}}.<ref name="https" /><ref name="Japan Tourism Agency,Japan Tourism Agency" />

